2026-11-12T20:13:32.0624099Z [36;1m[0m
2026-11-12T20:13:32.0624384Z [36;1m# `VsDevCmd.bat` is a batch file, so invoke it under `cmd.exe`, suppress its[0m
2026-11-12T20:13:32.0624884Z [36;1m# banner, then dump the resulting environment with `set`. Re-export only the[0m
